MATRIX: A stack is a garage. Push concatenates. Pop drops the last element.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE push WITH stack AND value
  CASH OUT stack PLUS [value]
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE top WITH stack
  CASH OUT CALL at (stack, MINUS 1)
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE pop WITH stack
  BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL length WITH stack
  IF n IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
    CASH OUT []
  PERIOD
  CASH OUT CALL piece (stack, 0, n MINUS 1)
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI stack EQUALS []
BUGATTI stack EQUALS CALL push (stack, 10)
BUGATTI stack EQUALS CALL push (stack, 20)
BUGATTI stack EQUALS CALL push (stack, 30)
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI stack
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL top WITH stack
BUGATTI stack EQUALS CALL pop WITH stack
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI stack

